# "Effects that remove all damage from a permanent (such as regeneration) will still remove damage from Ancient
# Adamantoise" (the ruling; CR 701.19a). Bot2's Lightning Bolt at Bot1 on turn 2 is dealt to the Adamantoise, and the 3
# damage stays through cleanup (CR 514.2). On turn 4 Baleful Strix (deathtouch) attacks Bot1; Bot1 gives the Adamantoise a
# regeneration shield with Yavimaya Hollow, and the Strix's damage, dealt to the Adamantoise instead, would destroy it:
# it regenerates - tapped, and all its damage removed, the 3 it kept included.

